1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,621
June's single SUGAR HONEY ICE TEA went to number one on YouTube's global daily music chart and sprinted past a hundred million views.

2
00:00:08,621 --> 00:00:19,213
And on TikTok, a piece of choreography from the CHOOM era detached itself from the song entirely — the AH-hyun March, a stride so distinctive it became a format.

3
00:00:19,213 --> 00:00:20,966
Millions of imitations.

4
00:00:20,966 --> 00:00:22,577
Brazilian funk edits.

5
00:00:22,577 --> 00:00:25,695
A walk, literally, copied around the world.

